{"base":{"webm":"/voice/i-dont-care-base-ef08ed3ae506.webm","m4a":"/voice/i-dont-care-base-ef08ed3ae506.m4a","lines":{"alex|Three meetings down. Brain empty.":[0,2397],"me|Lunch time. What are we feeling?":[2547,2283],"alex|Tacos or ramen. Help me choose.":[4980,2186],"alex|So, tacos or ramen?":[7316,1624],"me|Honestly, I don't care!":[9090,1685],"alex|Oh… okay, sorry for asking.":[10925,3460],"me|Whatever you want!":[14535,1277],"alex|Uh… sure. Tacos, I guess?":[15963,2744],"me|Either works for me!":[18857,1395],"alex|Nice! Ramen it is!":[20402,1955],"me|I don't mind either way!":[22507,1555],"alex|Awesome, let's do tacos!":[24212,1537]}},"followUp":{"webm":"/voice/i-dont-care-followUp-226d89cbe536.webm","m4a":"/voice/i-dont-care-followUp-226d89cbe536.m4a","lines":{"alex|Whoa, no line today!":[0,1945],"me|Lucky. Window seat's open!":[2095,2045],"alex|Is this table okay?":[4290,1157],"me|Yeah, it's okay!":[5597,1308],"alex|Just okay? We can move!":[7055,2543],"me|Yeah, I don't care!":[9748,1368],"alex|Whoa… rough morning?":[11266,2358],"me|Perfect, works for me!":[13773,1429],"alex|Awesome! Ramen time!":[15352,1849],"me|Yeah, not bad!":[17352,1243],"alex|Hmm… want a booth instead?":[18744,2640]}}}